---
<section class="py-24 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-label-md font-bold text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Who We Are</p>
        <h2 class="text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-6">
          Architectural Mastery & Engineering Precision
        </h2>
        <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6">
          At Paanya Empire, we don't just build structures; we craft legacies. As a premium turnkey construction and real estate firm, we specialize in delivering unparalleled luxury, absolute transparency, and uncompromising quality.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-8">
          From concept to completion, our team of expert architects, engineers, and designers work in perfect harmony to bring your vision to life, ensuring every detail reflects our commitment to excellence.
        </p>
        <a href="/about" class="inline-flex items-center text-primary font-bold hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">
          Discover Our Story
          <svg class="ml-2 w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="relative h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        <img 
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" 
          alt="Modern luxury interior designed by Paanya Empire" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
        <!-- Decorative element -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-32 h-32 bg-primary rounded-full opacity-20 blur-2xl"></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
